      "items": [
        "pending 0, ready_to_ship 1, picked_up 2, in_transit 3, out_for_delivery and undelivered 4, delivered 5, rto_initiated 6, rto_delivered 7, cancelled and lost 8.",
        "A courier event only moves a shipment to a higher rank, or to an equal rank when it is newer."
